ypeMap = {\n        unpaid: 'warning',\n        pending: 'info',\n        serving: 'primary',\n        completed: 'success',\n        closed: 'danger'\n      };\n      return typeMap[status] || 'info';\n    },\n    viewOrder: function viewOrder(order) {\n      var _this = this;\n      return _asyncToGenerator(/*#__PURE__*/_regenerator().m(function _callee() {\n        var detail, _t;\n        return _regenerator().w(function (_context) {\n          while (1) switch (_context.p = _context.n) {\n            case 0:\n              _context.p = 0;\n              _this.detailLoading = true;\n              _context.n = 1;\n              return getDetail(order.id);\n            case 1:\n              detail = _context.v;\n              _this.orderDetail = detail;\n              _this.showOrderDetail = true;\n              _context.n = 3;\n              break;\n            case 2:\n              _context.p = 2;\n              _t = _context.v;\n              _this.$message.error('获取订单详情失败，请稍后重试');\n              console.error('获取订单详情失败:', _t);\n            case 3:\n              _context.p = 3;\n              _this.detailLoading = false;\n              return _context.f(3);\n            case 4:\n              return _context.a(2);\n          }\n        }, _callee, null, [[0, 2, 3, 4]]);\n      }))();\n    },\n    contactUser: function contactUser(order) {\n      try {\n        // 根据订单类型设置聊天对象\n        if (this.orderType === 'buy') {\n          // 购买方联系服务提供方\n          this.chatUserId = order.providerId || '1';\n          this.chatUserName = order.providerName || '服务商';\n          this.chatUserAvatar = order.providerAvatar || '';\n        } else {\n          // 服务提供方联系购买方\n          this.chatUserId = order.userId || '1';\n          this.chatUserName = order.userName || '客户';\n          this.chatUserAvatar = order.userAvatar || '';\n        }\n        this.showChat = true;\n      } catch (e) {\n        this.$message.error('打开聊天窗口失败，请稍后重试');\n        console.error('打开聊天窗口失败:', e);\n      }\n    },\n    payOrder: function payOrder(order) {\n      // 这里可以添加支付订单的逻辑\n      this.$message.info(\"\\u652F\\u4ED8\\u8BA2\\u5355 \".concat(order.id));\n    },\n    confirmOrder: function confirmOrder(order) {\n      // 这里可以添加确认订单的逻辑\n      this.$message.info(\"\\u786E\\u8BA4\\u8BA2\\u5355 \".concat(order.id));\n    },\n    completeOrder: function completeOrder(order) {\n      // 这里可以添加确认完成订单的逻辑\n      this.$message.info(\"\\u786E\\u8BA4\\u5B8C\\u6210\\u8BA2\\u5355 \".concat(order.id));\n    },\n    cancelOrder: function cancelOrder(order) {\n      // 这里可以添加取消订单的逻辑\n      this.$message.info(\"\\u53D6\\u6D88\\u8BA2\\u5355 \".concat(order.id));\n    },\n    load: function load() {\n      var _this2 = this;\n      return _asyncToGenerator(/*#__PURE__*/_regenerator().m(function _callee2() {\n        var res;\n        return _regenerator().w(function (_context2) {\n          while (1) switch (_context2.p = _context2.n) {\n            case 0:\n              _this2.loading = true;\n              _context2.p = 1;\n              _context2.n = 2;\n              return listMy(_objectSpread({\n                current: _this2.page.current,\n                size: _this2.page.size,\n                type: _this2.orderType\n              }, _this2.query));\n            case 2:\n              res = _context2.v;\n              _this2.list = res.records || [];\n              _this2.page.total = res.total || 0;\n            case 3:\n              _context2.p = 3;\n              _this2.loading = false;\n              return _context2.f(3);\n            case 4:\n              return _context2.a(2);\n          }\n        }, _callee2, null, [[1,, 3, 4]]);\n      }))();\n    },\n    onPage: function onPage(p) {\n      this.page.current = p;\n      this.load();\n    },\n    onSizeChange: function onSizeChange(size) {\n      this.page.size = size;\n      this.page.current = 1;\n      this.load();\n    },\n    handleSortChange: function handleSortChange(_ref) {\n      var prop = _